          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Ballerina Farm Farmer Protein is a good product with a premium price. It pairs grass-fed whey with collagen, colostrum, hemp and inulin fiber, sweetens with stevia and monk fruit, and lists 24 g of protein per serving. Buyers like the taste, and the label is short. But at roughly $2.20 to $2.90 per 25 g of protein, with an undisclosed collagen share, it is not a value buy.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
